        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Jason, brave hero of yesteryear, is roused from retirement by the news that mutant lifeeorms, thought to have been long since destroyed, are once again on the move, hollowing out subterranean niches in the image of their old haunts. The decision to reactivate Sophia seems to Jason nothing more than an inevitability. Back into the cold once more...\n\n- Eight areas to explore, to find the keys and kill the sub human bosses\n- Use the tank’s suction system to drive up walls and along ceilings\n- Drive Sophia or go it alone with Jason.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Jason, valiente héroe de antaño, sale de su retiro al saber que las formas de vida mutantes, que se creían destruidas hace tiempo, se han vuelto a mover, excavando nichos subterráneos a imagen de sus antiguos refugios. La decisión de reactivar a Sophia le parece a Jason poco más que algo inevitable. Otra vez a la intemperie...\n\n- Ocho áreas por explorar, para encontrar las llaves y derrotar a los jefes subhumanos\n- Usa el sistema de succión del tanque para subir por paredes y techos\n- Conduce a Sophia o ve solo con Jason.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
