        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Blaster Master Jr., known as Blaster Master Boy in North America and Bomber King: Scenario 2 (ボンバーキング シナリオ2?) in Japan, is an action video game developed by Aicom and published by Sunsoft. The game was released in 1991 for Game Boy. The game is a sequel to Robowarrior, a spin-off title in the Bomberman series by Hudson Soft. However, the game was marketed in western territories as a game in the Blaster Master series by Sunsoft.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Blaster Master Jr., conocido como Blaster Master Boy en Norteamérica y como Bomber King: Scenario 2 (ボンバーキング シナリオ2?) en Japón, es un videojuego de acción desarrollado por Aicom y publicado por Sunsoft. Salió a la venta en 1991 para Game Boy. Es la secuela de Robowarrior, un título derivado de la serie Bomberman de Hudson Soft. Sin embargo, en los territorios occidentales el juego se comercializó como parte de la serie Blaster Master de Sunsoft.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1991",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
